Marriage and Parenthood in This Time of the End
GOD’S Word foretold that “the time of the end ” would be marked by wars, earthquakes, famines, and pestilences.
Why are such changes of concern to us? Because they are so extensive and so powerful that they could influence how Christians today view marriage and parenthood.
How does the world in general view marriage and divorce? Nowadays, divorce has become easy and widespread, and the divorce rate in many countries is climbing.
How do Jehovah and Jesus Christ view marriage? Jehovah God expects those who are married to remain faithful to their marriage vow.
