A New, Pure Language
Through his prophet Zephaniah, Jehovah foretold: “Then I shall give to peoples the change to a pure language, in order for them all to call upon the name of Jehovah, in order to serve him shoulder to shoulder. ”
Learning the Pure Language
The same is true when we start to learn the pure language of Bible truth.
What will help us not only to understand the pure language but also to speak it fluently?
As with learning any language, there are some basic techniques that can help us to attain proficiency in speaking the language of Bible truth. Let us consider some of the basic steps used by people to learn another language and see how those steps can help us to learn this new figurative language.
Speaking the Pure Language Fluently
What must we do if we want to learn the pure language, and why is this so important? Listen carefully.
But as a person learns to concentrate on what he is hearing, he will start to recognize individual words and recurring patterns of speech.
