It is a personal plea to a friend.
REMAIN SPIRITUALLY HEALTHY
After providing guidance for the making of “appointments of older men in city after city, ” Paul counsels Titus to“ keep on reproving with severity, that they may be healthy in the faith. ”
The answer lies in understanding what Paul meant by “all things. ”
It is the opposite with someone whose thinking is distorted and whose conscience is defiled.
They are ‘ saved through a bath ’ in that God has bathed, or cleansed, them with the blood of Jesus on the merit of the ransom sacrifice. They are ‘ made new by holy spirit ’ because they have become “a new creation ” as spirit - begotten sons of God. — 2 Cor.
Christian overseers must display courage in correcting what is defective in the congregation.
