How can our conduct affect the angels?
With great satisfaction, the angels observe our acts of faithfulness and even rejoice over the repentance of a sinner. The godly conduct of Christian women is noted by the angels.
The Bible shows that “the woman ought to have a sign of authority upon her head because of the angels. ”
