We maintain a clean conscience, which gives us peace of mind and a calm heart.
Also, when we are truthful in all things, we do not need to worry about being found out, or exposed, by humans. — 1 Tim.
Paul said: “In every way we recommend ourselves as God’s ministers,... by truthful speech. ”
