Although the “other sheep ” are not part of the composite body of Christ, they can learn much from this illustration. Paul states that Jehovah “subjected all things under feet, and made him head over all things to the congregation. ”
Today, the other sheep are part of “all things ” placed by Jehovah under the headship of his Son.
