Maintain Joy in Times of Trouble
Besides the calamities common to all humans, true Christians carry the figurative torture stake. Yes, like Jesus, his disciples are hated and persecuted.
Hence, following the Christ requires vigorous exertion and endurance while we await the blessings of the new world. — Matt.
Clearly, Jehovah wants us to be happy as we await the fulfillment of his promises.
