Philip was persuaded and sought out his friend Nathanael, telling him: “We have found the one of whom Moses, in the Law, and the Prophets wrote, Jesus, the son of Joseph, from Nazareth. ” — John 1: 40, 41, 45.
Are you thoroughly convinced that Jesus is the promised Messiah, Jehovah’s ‘ Chief Agent of salvation ’?
From Jesus ’ birth to his resurrection, the Word of God gives conclusive proof that he was the Christ.
One researcher said that the odds that a person could fulfill all the Messianic prophecies by chance would be “so astronomical ” that it must be ruled out.
