After all, if in - law issues are a constant source of contention between you and your spouse, then what you really have is a marriage problem — not an in - law problem.
Many marriage problems arise because no two partners share precisely the same view of a matter. Can you try to see things from your mate’s perspective?
This caused conflict within our marriage because my wife still wanted to be close to her family, especially her mother. ”
Many conflicts with in - laws can be alleviated by discerning their motives and by refusing to allow these conflicts to cause contention between you and your spouse.
