What did it cost? How can I benefit from this precious provision that can save me from God’s wrath?
Saved From God’s Wrath
What proves that God’s wrath remains upon the present wicked system of things?
The Bible and the hard facts of history show that ever since Adam’s fall into sin, God’s wrath ‘ has remained upon ’ the human race.
Satan’s rival sovereignty has been totally unable to protect mankind from ongoing calamities, and no human government has been capable of fulfilling the basic needs of all its citizens.
So mankind continues to be plagued by war, crime, and poverty. Clearly, then, Jehovah’s blessing is not upon the present wicked system of things.
What work is being spearheaded by anointed Christians, and what opportunity is still open to individuals who are part of Satan’s world?
