No, for the door leading to reconciliation with Jehovah is still wide open.
Anointed Christians, who are “ambassadors substituting for Christ, ” are spearheading a public ministry by means of which people of all nations are being entreated:“ Become reconciled to God. ” — 2 Cor.
Adam and Eve were created perfect. If they had remained obedient to God, the earth would now be full of their happy offspring living together with them in Paradise.
