We need to allow God’s Word to mold our understanding of Jehovah’s mind.
Like Job, when we start to understand the mind of Jehovah, we cannot help but exclaim: “Look! These are the fringes of his ways, and what a whisper of a matter has been heard of him!
We will thus be prompted to agree with these words of the apostle Paul: “O the depth of God’s riches and wisdom and knowledge!
